## SQLite

The SQL engine ancestry (SQL parsing, planner, VM, B-tree and file format) is
derived from SQLite, which is released into the public domain. SQLite is
available at https://sqlite.org.

## miniocpp

The S3-compatible object-storage client is provided by miniocpp, licensed
under the Apache License 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0),
obtained via vcpkg (port `minio-cpp`).

